      <span class="logo-text"
        ><span class="brand-quran">Quran</span>
        <span class="brand-studio">Studio</span></span
      >
      <p>
        Quran Studio is a modern Desktop application that empowers users to
        create beautiful, shareable Quranic videos optimized for YouTube,
        Instagram Reels, and more.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="/features">Features</a>
      <a href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a>
      <a href="/download">Download</a>
      <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/DashingMZA/quran-studio"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">GitHub</a
      >
      <a
        href="https://github.com/DashingMZA/quran-studio/releases"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener">Releases</a
